 app and let it run in the background.Do your normal work, study, or type on your real keyboard!Your typing will magically generate \"Inspiration\" to breathe life into your oasis.Try completing a 30-minute Pomodoro session with it! I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T05:57:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721189577","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4688280-1831432155575048","game_id":"steam-4688280","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Desktop Oasis! Your Ultimate Digital Zen is Coming Soon.","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome to the Desktop Oasis! Have you ever felt exhausted by endless coding, spreadsheets, or study sessions? We created Desktop Oasis precisely for this reason. It's not just a game; it's an \"emotional antidote\" sitting quietly in the corner of your monitor. What can you expect?Type to Earn: We monitor your global keystrokes safely in the background (zero performance impact!). Every time you work hard, your miniature ecosystem grows. Real 3D Physics on Desktop: Deploy boats","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T08:53:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155575048","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4688280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4688280":"2026-10-26T13:37:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4688280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:23Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:23Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:23Z"},"4720580":{"last_attempt_at